   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
25 |     count :: (self: *Plain) -> i64 { self.n }
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
26 | }
   | ^

error: 'impl Series' names a generic carrier but no binder among its type arguments
  --> examples/diagnostics/2029-diagnostics-blanket-impl-refusals.sx:29:1
   |
